\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces t-SNE of EfficientNet-B4 average-pool features (1792-dim) across three domains. HistoricalCrack (green circles), CrackForest (orange triangles), and Masonry (red squares) form three clearly separated clusters, confirming genuine domain shift. The partial overlap between HistoricalCrack and CrackForest is consistent with the 9.97 pp recall drop; the larger Masonry separation explains the 23.16 pp drop.}}{23}{figure.caption.12}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:tsne}{{5}{23}{t-SNE of EfficientNet-B4 average-pool features (1792-dim) across three domains. HistoricalCrack (green circles), CrackForest (orange triangles), and Masonry (red squares) form three clearly separated clusters, confirming genuine domain shift. The partial overlap between HistoricalCrack and CrackForest is consistent with the 9.97 pp recall drop; the larger Masonry separation explains the 23.16 pp drop}{figure.caption.12}{}}
